core/ — prime-agent
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Everything under core/ is a vendored fork of prime-agent:

  Upstream:  https://github.com/PrimeIntellect-ai/prime-agent
  Fork:      https://github.com/shitianfang/prime-agent
  Vendored:  commit fcc7f02541a77f61edecbcbb9a9f9fa2895bf128
  License:   MIT — Copyright (c) 2025 Mario Zechner
                   Copyright (c) 2026 Prime Intellect
             Full text retained at core/LICENSE.

The fork carries eight changes not present upstream at the time of vendoring:

  - preview.publish — agents declare work products as a host request
  - machine-readable status for refinements, autonomy, children, auto-refine
  - autonomous status mirrored on connection state
  - limit overrides on /autonomous on
  - the refiner emits a concise display title for each lesson
  - root agents switch autonomous mode through a bundled skill
  - the limit-smuggling guard closed on the key half, mid-turn hold proven
  - autonomous.enable payloads read only the named limit keys

These raise the daemon schema from 25 to 27. They are offered upstream; the
subtree is pulled forward with `npm run core:pull`.
